  ; ea:attribute [ ea:name "Id" ; ea:position 1 ; ea:typeName "AccessSpaceIdType" ; ea:lowerBound "1" ; ea:upperBound "1" ; ea:definition "Identifier of ACCESS SPACE." ]
  .

tm:TYPE_OF_PASSAGE a owl:Class ;
  rdfs:label "TYPE OF PASSAGE"
  ; rdfs:comment "A classification for spaces to express how the space can be used as a passage (e.g., as pathway, corridor, overpass, underpass, tunnel, etc.)."
  ; skos:definition "A classification for spaces to express how the space can be used as a passage (e.g., as pathway, corridor, overpass, underpass, tunnel, etc.)."
