  ; skos:definition "The assignment of one SCHEDULED STOP POINT and one JOURNEY PATTERN to a PASSENGER INFORMATION EQUIPMENT specifying that information on the SCHEDULED STOP POINT and the JOURNEY PATTERN will be provided (e.g., displayed, printed)."
