  ; skos:definition "Change of the status of a SCHEDULED STOP POINT, a STOP PLACE or a QUAY, impacting all the DATED VEHICLE JOURNEYs in a certain period of time.  NOTE: This CONTROL ACTION is mainly used for stop closing or opening, and will give rise to further actions such as CHANGE OF JOURNEY PATTERNs or PARTIAL JOURNEY CANCELLATIONs."
