tm:CANCELLED_DATED_VEHICLE_JOURNEY_ENTRY a owl:Class ;
  rdfs:label "CANCELLED DATED VEHICLE JOURNEY ENTRY"
  ; rdfs:comment "The class CANCELLED DATED VEHICLE JOURNEY ENTRY represents an individual record of a specific DATED VEHICLE JOURNEY that was cancelled. It provides detailed information about the cancellation, including the reference to the OPERATING DAY, the associated SERVICE JOURNEY, and the planned VEHICLE JOURNEY. This class ensures traceability by linking the cancellation event to the original scheduled journey and may include attributes such as cancellation reason, timestamp, and responsible authority. Its purpose is to capture granular cancellation data for operational analysis and reporting."
  ; skos:definition "The class CANCELLED DATED VEHICLE JOURNEY ENTRY represents an individual record of a specific DATED VEHICLE JOURNEY that was cancelled. It provides detailed information about the cancellation, including the reference to the OPERATING DAY, the associated SERVICE JOURNEY, and the planned VEHICLE JOURNEY. This class ensures traceability by linking the cancellation event to the original scheduled journey and may include attributes such as cancellation reason, timestamp, and responsible authority. Its purpose is to capture granular cancellation data for operational analysis and reporting."
  ; rdfs:subClassOf tm:INDICATOR_LOG_ENTRY
  ; ea:kind "class"
  ; ea:attribute [ ea:name "Id" ; ea:position 1 ; ea:typeName "CancelledDatedVehicleJourneyEntryIdType" ; ea:lowerBound "1" ; ea:upperBound "1" ; ea:definition "<font color=\"#0f0f0f\">Identifier of CANCELLED DATED VEHICLE JOURNEY ENTRY.</font>" ]
  .

tm:CANCELLED_JOURNEY_OCCURRENCE a owl:Class ;
  rdfs:label "CANCELLED JOURNEY OCCURRENCE"
  ; rdfs:comment "The class CANCELLED JOURNEY OCCURRENCE represents an aggregated indicator of how often cancellations occur within a defined public transport context. It is derived from CANCELLED DATED VEHICLE JOURNEY COUNT and expresses the number of cancellations or their percentage relative to the total scheduled journeys. This class is linked to the OCCURRENCE concept from the generic aggregation model, which provides attributes such as NumberOfOccurrences and PercentageOfOccurrences. Its purpose is to enable high-level reporting and KPI calculations for service reliability, allowing operators to monitor cancellation trends across different scopes such as LINE, NETWORK, or OPERATING DAY."
  ; skos:definition "The class CANCELLED JOURNEY OCCURRENCE represents an aggregated indicator of how often cancellations occur within a defined public transport context. It is derived from CANCELLED DATED VEHICLE JOURNEY COUNT and expresses the number of cancellations or their percentage relative to the total scheduled journeys. This class is linked to the OCCURRENCE concept from the generic aggregation model, which provides attributes such as NumberOfOccurrences and PercentageOfOccurrences. Its purpose is to enable high-level reporting and KPI calculations for service reliability, allowing operators to monitor cancellation trends across different scopes such as LINE, NETWORK, or OPERATING DAY."
  ; rdfs:subClassOf tm:OCCURRENCE
  ; ea:kind "class"
  ; ea:attribute [ ea:name "Id" ; ea:position 1 ; ea:typeName "CancelledJourneyOccurenceIdType" ; ea:lowerBound "1" ; ea:upperBound "1" ; ea:definition "<font color=\"#0f0f0f\">Identifier of CANCELLED JOURNEY OCCURENCE.</font>" ]
  .

tm:CANCELLED_DATED_VEHICLE_JOURNEY_COUNT a owl:Class ;
  rdfs:label "CANCELLED DATED VEHICLE JOURNEY COUNT"
  ; rdfs:comment "The class CANCELLED DATED VEHICLE JOURNEY COUNT aggregates the number of cancelled DATED VEHICLE JOURNEY instances within a defined context, such as an OPERATING DAY, a LINE, or a NETWORK. Instead of storing individual entries, it provides a summarized count, enabling performance monitoring and statistical analysis of service reliability. This class is essential for high-level reporting and trend evaluation, supporting KPIs related to cancellations."
  ; skos:definition "The class CANCELLED DATED VEHICLE JOURNEY COUNT aggregates the number of cancelled DATED VEHICLE JOURNEY instances within a defined context, such as an OPERATING DAY, a LINE, or a NETWORK. Instead of storing individual entries, it provides a summarized count, enabling performance monitoring and statistical analysis of service reliability. This class is essential for high-level reporting and trend evaluation, supporting KPIs related to cancellations."
  ; rdfs:subClassOf tm:INDICATOR
  ; ea:kind "class"
  ; ea:attribute [ ea:name "Id" ; ea:position 1 ; ea:typeName "CancelledDatedVehicleJourneyCountIdType" ; ea:lowerBound "1" ; ea:upperBound "1" ; ea:definition "<font color=\"#0f0f0f\">Identifier of CANCELLED DATED VEHICLE COUNT.</font>" ]
  .

tm:LATE_JOURNEY_INTERVAL a owl:Class ;
  rdfs:label "LATE JOURNEY INTERVAL"
  ; rdfs:comment "The class LATE JOURNEY INTERVAL defines a time-based category used to classify delays of DATED VEHICLE JOURNEY instances into predefined duration ranges. It is associated with the DURATION INTERVAL concept, which includes attributes such as start and end duration, inclusiveness, and interval type. This class enables grouping of late journeys by severity (e.g., 0–5 minutes, 6–10 minutes) for reporting and KPI calculations. It is essential for aggregating punctuality data into meaningful intervals for trend analysis and performance evaluation."
  ; skos:definition "The class LATE JOURNEY INTERVAL defines a time-based category used to classify delays of DATED VEHICLE JOURNEY instances into predefined duration ranges. It is associated with the DURATION INTERVAL concept, which includes attributes such as start and end duration, inclusiveness, and interval type. This class enables grouping of late journeys by severity (e.g., 0–5 minutes, 6–10 minutes) for reporting and KPI calculations. It is essential for aggregating punctuality data into meaningful intervals for trend analysis and performance evaluation."
  ; rdfs:subClassOf tm:DURATION_INTERVAL
  ; ea:kind "class"
  ; ea:attribute [ ea:name "Id" ; ea:position 1 ; ea:typeName "LateJourneyIntervalIdType" ; ea:lowerBound "1" ; ea:upperBound "1" ; ea:definition "<font color=\"#0f0f0f\">Identifier of LATE JOURNEY INTERVAL</font>" ]
  .

tm:LATE_DATED_VEHICLE_JOURNEY_ENTRY a owl:Class ;
  rdfs:label "LATE DATED VEHICLE JOURNEY ENTRY"
  ; rdfs:comment "The class LATE DATED VEHICLE JOURNEY ENTRY represents a detailed record of a specific DATED VEHICLE JOURNEY that experienced a delay beyond its scheduled time. It captures the operational context by referencing OPERATING DAY, SERVICE JOURNEY, and VEHICLE JOURNEY, and includes attributes such as the actual delay duration, the point of delay detection, and possibly the reason for lateness. This class provides granular data for analyzing punctuality and identifying patterns of delay at the journey level."
  ; skos:definition "The class LATE DATED VEHICLE JOURNEY ENTRY represents a detailed record of a specific DATED VEHICLE JOURNEY that experienced a delay beyond its scheduled time. It captures the operational context by referencing OPERATING DAY, SERVICE JOURNEY, and VEHICLE JOURNEY, and includes attributes such as the actual delay duration, the point of delay detection, and possibly the reason for lateness. This class provides granular data for analyzing punctuality and identifying patterns of delay at the journey level."
  ; rdfs:subClassOf tm:INDICATOR_LOG_ENTRY
  ; ea:kind "class"
  ; ea:attribute [ ea:name "id" ; ea:position 1 ; ea:typeName "LateDatedVehicleJourneyEntryIdType" ; ea:lowerBound "1" ; ea:upperBound "1" ; ea:definition "<font color=\"#0f0f0f\">Identifier of LATE DATED VEHICLE JOURNEY ENTRY.</font>" ]
  .

tm:LATE_JOURNEY_OCCURRENCES a owl:Class ;
  rdfs:label "LATE JOURNEY OCCURRENCES"
  ; rdfs:comment "The class LATE JOURNEY OCCURRENCE represents the aggregated number of late journeys within a specific LATE JOURNEY INTERVAL category. It includes attributes such as the number of occurrences and percentage of occurrences, providing statistical insight into how often delays fall into each interval. This class supports high-level reporting and helps identify patterns of lateness across different operational contexts, such as LINE, NETWORK, or OPERATING DAY."
  ; skos:definition "The class LATE JOURNEY OCCURRENCE represents the aggregated number of late journeys within a specific LATE JOURNEY INTERVAL category. It includes attributes such as the number of occurrences and percentage of occurrences, providing statistical insight into how often delays fall into each interval. This class supports high-level reporting and helps identify patterns of lateness across different operational contexts, such as LINE, NETWORK, or OPERATING DAY."
  ; rdfs:subClassOf tm:OCCURRENCE
  ; ea:kind "class"
  ; ea:attribute [ ea:name "Id" ; ea:position 1 ; ea:typeName "LateJourneyOccurenceIdType" ; ea:lowerBound "1" ; ea:upperBound "1" ; ea:definition "<font color=\"#0f0f0f\">Identifier of LATE JOURNEY OCCURENCE.</font>" ]
  .

tm:LATE_DATED_VEHICLE_JOURNEY_COUNT a owl:Class ;
  rdfs:label "LATE DATED VEHICLE JOURNEY COUNT"
  ; rdfs:comment "The class LATE DATED VEHICLE JOURNEY COUNT aggregates the number of late DATED VEHICLE JOURNEY instances within a defined scope, such as an OPERATING DAY, a LINE, or a NETWORK. Instead of storing individual delay records, it summarizes occurrences to support high-level reporting and performance monitoring. This class is essential for generating KPIs related to service punctuality and for trend analysis across multiple operating periods."
  ; skos:definition "The class LATE DATED VEHICLE JOURNEY COUNT aggregates the number of late DATED VEHICLE JOURNEY instances within a defined scope, such as an OPERATING DAY, a LINE, or a NETWORK. Instead of storing individual delay records, it summarizes occurrences to support high-level reporting and performance monitoring. This class is essential for generating KPIs related to service punctuality and for trend analysis across multiple operating periods."
  ; rdfs:subClassOf tm:INDICATOR
  ; ea:kind "class"
  ; ea:attribute [ ea:name "Id" ; ea:position 1 ; ea:typeName "LateDatedVehicleJourneyCountIdType" ; ea:lowerBound "1" ; ea:upperBound "1" ; ea:definition "<font color=\"#0f0f0f\">Identifier of LATE DATED VEHICLE JOURNEY COUNT.</font>" ]
  .

